WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:06.800
It's all things trying to steal our life energy, our love, our pure hearts.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:08.850
And now they're after our dreams.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:12.090
Without our dreams, how can we hope for a tomorrow?

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.730
I won't let them get away with this.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:18.900
I'm Sailor Moon. Watch me stop them.

00:00:30.508 --> 00:00:31.008
All right.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.640
forest is weeping. Our crystal

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:12.380
forest is weeping. If you

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.730
can hear me, if you can hear me,

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:28.370
at all. Please, come to the forest. I have traveled all night long just to see only you.

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:25.570
Strange move.

00:03:30.412 --> 00:03:31.412
I'm coming!

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:39.360
What?

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:49.620
