Should you be skipping work now, Andrew?

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:18.300
Sure. The arcade can't compete with this way cool event.

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:20.540
True. That's a good reason.

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:22.800
Yeah, because we're waiting to see something

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:25.680
