00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:29.510
The sun, the moon, and the earth will soon line up.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:34.500
You won't be able to see the sun because it'll be hiding behind the moon.

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:40.610
When the sun is completely hidden by the moon, like today, we call it a solar eclipse.

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:48.410
Yeah, the bright sun is hidden away behind the moon, and it gets really, really dark.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:54.180
It's spooky and scary, and you don't know what's gonna happen.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:59.940
Serena, why do you tell Rini's scary?

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.620
Don't bother, Ray.

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:06.440
I don't pay attention to most of the things Serena says anyways.

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:09.260
Hey, what do you mean by saying that, huh?

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:13.380
Did I say something wrong?

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:17.520
