00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:44.160
Aha, I wonder.

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:47.150
Are you thinking about someone you've met?

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:52.180
Listen, you shouldn't be doing anything that'll upset your mom and dad.

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:55.540
You should talk.

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.010
What you mean?

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:59.980
Mom's been worried sick about you because you've been coming home.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:08.460
pretty late these days mind your own business girls it's starting now

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.460
Must be this dark at night when no lights are on.

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:50.220
So strange and calm.

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:29.970
Of course.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:59.820
it there before. Serena, what are you waiting for? We're leaving. What? Without me? No.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.450
They haven't noticed! They haven't noticed!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.650
People in this city don't notice anything!

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:08.420
They don't even stop to notice they act like dogs!

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:11.720
They don't even stop to notice their kids are monkeys!

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.840
