00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.790
In the middle of the city out of the blue!

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:24.550
These people don't even notice it at all!

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:29.840
Why? Why? Why? Why? Why? Why?

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:31.500
I wonder why.

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:37.060
They're the kind of people that only care about what's happening in their own little lives.

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:45.660
So then, even if the whole world is at their feet, even if a tent appears suddenly in the middle of their city,

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:49.420
the people around here would never notice at all!

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:06.550
Quiet! I said, quiet!

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:25.640
Good, now.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:35.990
Last, the time has come for us to conquer and rule this world, Amazon Trio.

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:38.340
Are you there?

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:43.530
Tiger's Eye, present.

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:53.310
Xav, present.

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:56.850
Your service, Master Zuconia.

00:10:58.280 --> 00:10:59.980
Listen, the go-

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.940
The good one must have taken a refuge here.

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:06.550
We have to find him and capture him before we can rule this world.

00:11:06.860 --> 00:11:09.580
Now, Amazon Trio, I want you to go out there and take care of it.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:17.480
First thing is find the one who has beautiful dreams.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.460
