00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:39.810
There is only one way he can exist in this world.

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:41.090
What's that?

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:46.210
By hiding and living inside some person's beautiful dream.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:47.780
I understand.

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:50.160
