00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:53.660
He's here when he's found someone who dreams beautiful dreams, Master Zirconia?

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:55.690
You are so correct!

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:59.960
The world is big and...

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:07.870
people but only a few of them can have beautiful dreams someone will have seen him by now i'm sure

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:14.530
so you must go out and find him and bring him to me

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:43.350
Look here. What about this girl?

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:45.270
No, I don't think so.

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.620
Hmm, this isn't going to be so easy.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.140
There are a lot of girls here to choose from.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:54.020
Best of all, they're easy on the eyes.

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:55.100
They're all attractive.

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.180
