00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:59.140
We're looking for the one who has beautiful dreams, not face.

00:12:59.180 --> 00:12:59.320
What?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.830
I mean, they're all so sweet.

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:05.210
I don't believe your taste, tiger's eye.

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:07.240
You can't understand my taste

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:08.800
