00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:15.950
She's your type, all right,

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:18.410
but how can you be so sure she's gonna be easily fooled?

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:19.230
Got a plan?

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:21.910
She'll be fooled if you make her think

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:24.010
